cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use SciProof in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "SciProof"
abstract: >-
  Record a computational experiment once, then let anyone check the evidence: file hashes,
  opt-in re-execution with numeric tolerances, claims, signatures and policies. Local-first,
  no runtime dependencies.
type: software
authors:
  - name: "HayagrivAI Labs"
version: 0.3.2
date-released: 2026-10-23
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/hayagrivai-labs/sciproof"
url: "https://hayagrivai-labs.github.io/sciproof/"
keywords:
  - reproducibility
  - provenance
  - research software
  - verification
